{
  "name": "WhatsApp sale to Meta Conversions API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp sale to Meta Conversions API\n\n**What it does**\nWhen a sale closes in a WhatsApp chat that started from a click-to-WhatsApp ad, this sends a Purchase event to Meta's Conversions API with the ad click ID (`ctwa_clid`). Meta can then credit the ad and optimise for buyers, not just chats. Every attempt is logged in Google Sheets.\n\n**You need**\n- A Meta dataset (Events Manager) linked to your WhatsApp Business Account\n- A system user access token that can send events to that dataset\n- The `ctwa_clid` of the chat (workflow 07 saves it from the first message)\n- Google Sheets connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. In **Build the Purchase event**, set your WABA ID and currency. In **Send to Meta Conversions API**, replace `YOUR_DATASET_ID`.\n2. Create a Query Auth credential: name `access_token`, value your token. Paste your sheet ID (tab `Meta events`) into **Log the result**.\n3. Activate and POST a test sale to the webhook (example in the README). Use `test_event_code` first.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "34137102-0a8a-5ce7-9ce0-94852f99aca0",
      "name": "WhatsApp sale to Meta Conversions API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Build the Purchase event**: `WABA_ID`, `DEFAULT_CURRENCY`.\n**Send to Meta Conversions API**: dataset ID in the URL, your Query Auth credential.\n**Log the result**: sheet ID.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "6224d4a2-e55c-54d3-ae60-f3930cfbeccf",
      "name": "Edit me: IDs and currency",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-sale",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0edf86e-9d70-58d3-94d0-899a3d176655",
      "name": "Sale closed in WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "39025ef6-318e-586e-b7e2-d14c12441de7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Edit these two values.\nconst WABA_ID = 'YOUR_WABA_ID';        // WhatsApp Business Account ID\nconst DEFAULT_CURRENCY = 'USD';\n\n// Expected body: { order_id, value, currency?, ctwa_clid, event_time?, test_event_code? }\nconst sale = $json.body ?? {};\nconst now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);\nlet eventTime = Number(sale.event_time) || now;\nif (eventTime > 1e12) eventTime = Math.floor(eventTime / 1000); // accept milliseconds too\n\nconst value = Number(sale.value);\nconst clickId = String(sale.ctwa_clid ?? '').trim();\n\nlet skipReason = '';\nif (!clickId) skipReason = 'no ctwa_clid: chat did not start from a click-to-WhatsApp ad';\nelse if (!(value > 0)) skipReason = 'missing or invalid value';\nelse if (now - eventTime > 7 * 24 * 3600) skipReason = 'sale is older than 7 days, Meta rejects it';\n\nconst event = {\n  event_name: 'Purchase',\n  event_time: eventTime,\n  event_id: String(sale.order_id ?? `wa-${clickId}-${eventTime}`), // lets Meta drop duplicates\n  action_source: 'business_messaging',\n  messaging_channel: 'whatsapp',\n  user_data: {\n    whatsapp_business_account_id: WABA_ID,\n    ctwa_clid: clickId,\n  },\n  custom_data: {\n    currency: String(sale.currency || DEFAULT_CURRENCY).toUpperCase(),\n    value,\n  },\n};\n\nconst payload = { data: [event] };\nif (sale.test_event_code) payload.test_event_code = String(sale.test_event_code);\n\nreturn { json: { payload, skipReason, orderId: event.event_id, value, currency: event.custom_data.currency } };"
      },
